sy cavity and is located 7 2cm from the deep  margin   Also in the upper outer quadrant  there is a second  firm  white   well circumscribed nodule  0 3 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm    located 5 0cm deep to the  large mass and 1 9cm from the deep margin  The remainder of breast tissue is  approximately 80  fat and 20  fibrous tissue  Representative sections are  submitted for microscopic examination   Micro  1  Biopsy cavity candidate site  2 frags  RSS   Micro  2  Firm area at probable biopsy cavity  1 frag  RSS   Micro  3  Medial biopsy cavity  2 frags  RSS   Micro  4  Margin deep to biopsy cavity  1 frag  RSS   Micro  5  Extremely firm mass subjacent to biopsy cavity  1 frag  RSS   Micro  6  More lateral section of extremely firm mass  2 frags  RSS   Micro  7  Deep margin to nodule  to include small  well circumscribed nodule   1 frag  RSS   Micro  8  Nipple with subjacent breast tissue  1 frag  RSS   Micro  9  Upper outer quadrant  1 frag  RSS   Micro  10  Upper inner quadrant  1 frag  RSS   Micro  11  Lower outer quadrant  1 frag  RSS   Micro  12  Lower inner quadrant  1 frag  RSS   The second part  sublabeled   2   skin left breast   consists of four fragments  of unoriented skin  the largest of which is a circle  13 1 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm    with a central  punched out concentric circle  5cm in diameter   with a  cut out radial projection  3 5 x 0 6cm    The other three skin fragments are  triangles  9 0 x 6 5cm to a depth of 0 9cm REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm to a depth of REMOVED_DATE  cm  and REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm to a depth of 0 4cm    The largest fragment is inked by  assigning the radial projection to 12 o clock and inking from 12 to 3 to 6  o clock in black  and from 6 to 9 to 12 o clock in blue  In the largest  fragment  the radial defect is firm  fibrous  and consistent with a scar site   and it is possible to overlay the segment on the mastectomy specimen  Part   1   such that it overlies the exposed biopsy site  There are no gross  lesions identified  Representative sections are submitted for microscopic  examination   Micro  13  En face black margin at 12 o clock with perpendicular blue margin  at 12 o clock  2 frags  RSS   Micro  14  Perpendicular  black  2 o clock firm area  1 frag  RSS   pab   Reports to  RHEI  ESTHER M D   SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST MASTECTOMY   PARTIAL OR SIMPLE  ADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE  SKIN  OTHER THAN CYST  TAG OR DEBRIDEMENT   report_end  , Absent.
